Third-party libraries bundled into Maprizon.jar
-----------------------------------------------

The build unpacks these dependencies into the plugin jar. Each is under a
license compatible with GPL-2.0-or-later:

- protobuf-java 3.5.1        — BSD-3-Clause          (Google)
- slf4j-api 1.7.25           — MIT                   (QOS.ch)
- annotations 24.0.1         — Apache-2.0            (JetBrains)
- mapbox-vector-tile 3.1.0   — Apache-2.0            (Weather Decision Technologies)
- jts-core 1.15.1            — EDL-1.0               (LocationTech JTS; dual EPL-1.0/EDL-1.0,
                                                      used here under the EDL/BSD-style terms)
- pmtiles-reader 0.3.6       — MIT                   (Simon Poole; VarInt.java: Apache-2.0, Google)

JOSM core (josm-custom.jar) is a compile-time dependency only; it is provided by
the JOSM runtime and is NOT bundled into the plugin jar.
